  "about": "Landing door modelled as a product (alternative to the one nested in the lift): stainless frame jambs and header on the landing face, aluminium landing sill with groove, hanger header on the shaft side (+y), fast and slow telescopic panels, meeting edge, call station with up and down buttons, hall lantern with digits, bed-lift sign. Geometry drawn at the first type's size; brand, model and supplier open for review. Reference: query: door lift landing door bed doors hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=door+lift+landing+door+bed+doors+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
